  storyText: "AV Pad\n\nYou hotwire an Arasaka AV and lift off into the rain. Two security AVs follow.\n\nMirage: \"I can mask us for a few minutes. Pick a direction.\"\n\n1. Fly to the Badlands.\n2. Fly to Pacifica.\n3. Fly straight over Arasaka airspace downtown."
